{#
    Overview column (at least 1/2 of the page, see minWidthPerType in config/trinity.php). "Overview options" sets the source:
    - Entries: the chosen entries, in the editor's order;
    - News, Calendar, Knowledge base: the chosen entries first; "Dynamically fill" adds the newest entries of that section after
      them (without the chosen ones and the page itself);
    - "Related items" (the source's relatedField, e.g. relatedNews, only on a page in that section): the fill takes the newest
      entries related to the page first (see `related` in config/overview-sources.php), then the newest of the others.
    Fields of the other options are hidden by their conditions, Trinity empties them, so they come in empty here.
    "Card layout" Image left: horizontal cards, two per row; "Highlight the first card" (grid): one large card left, two
    horizontal ones right; "Link position" Top right: the link next to the title on large
    screens. In a column of at most half the page (narrow) the cards are always horizontal, one under the other, 3 at most:
    Card layout and Highlight are hidden there by their Column width condition. The overview itself: _partials/_overview.twig (also used for related news on every news item).
#}
{% set option = cell.overviewOptions.value ?? 'entries' %}
{% set sources = craft.app.config.getConfigFromFile('overview-sources') %}
{% set source = sources[option] ?? sources.entries %}

{# chosen: Craft reports a field that isn't in the layout as defined but null #}
{% include '_site/_snippet/_content/_partials/_overview' with {
    option: option,
    type: cell.overviewType.value ?? 'grid',
    chosen: (cell[source.field] ?? null) is not null ? cell[source.field].eagerly().all() : [],
    dynamicFill: cell.dynamicFill,
    relatedBy: (source.relatedField ?? null) ? (cell[source.relatedField] ?? '') ~ '' : '',
    page: entry ?? null,
    title: cell.blockTitle,
    hideTitle: not craft.statik.showsTitle(cell),
    intro: cell.text ?? '',
    link: cell.linkField,
    linkPosition: cell.linkPosition.value ?? 'below',
    cardLayout: cell.cardLayout.value ?? 'stacked',
    highlightFirst: cell.highlightFirst ?? false,
    narrow: column.width <= 0.5 + 0.001,
    sizes: column.sizes,
    contrast: contrast,
    siteSettings: siteSettings ?? null,
} only %}
